  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-annual Programme Estimate - Technical Cooperation Facility V and Support to the NAO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Programme Estimate forms part of the package of measures outlined in the Financing Agreement (FA), aimed at supporting the NAOs office to fully discharge its role in the management of EU resources and to provide the necessary tools for coordination of development aid resources and their visibility. Both the FA and the Programme Estimate are aligned to the National Indicative Programme (NIP) for the 11th EDF, which in turn is aligned to the national medium- and long-term development priorities and strategic frameworks. In this respect, the Programme Estimate will be implemented within the frameworks of the NIP, the Seventh National Development Plan 2017-2021 (7th NDP) and the Zambia Vision 2030 Strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
